      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">... ha-Kohen, the elder [b. ...] (may his) end be [go]od, to this lady Salim[a]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">... daughter of m(aster) \u02bfImran(?), (may the) Mer(ciful) ke(ep him), fourteen gold dinars; of them\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">eleven are the advanced mohar and three are delayed, \"on his neck.\u201d And he has al[re]ady paid</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">her [eleve]n dinars, the advanced mohar. And these are \\\\what he gave// a pair of gold earrings\u2014[-]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">a neckl[ace...]\u20144, a silver bangle\u2014[-], two shawq\u2014[-] , ... pots(?)</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and ... of copper\u20141[-], and two gold [dina]rs. They are what he [g]ave\u2014[eleve]n dinars. And there re[main \"on his nec]k\" three dinars, a debt, strong\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li></li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and firm. And the girl is of age, and sh[e is in] her own [ju]risdiction.\u00a0 She has already appointed m(aster)\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[.. .]m(?) her father, as [her] agent \u27e6and she is in her own jurisdiction\u27e7.\u00a0 And she has consented\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to all that he does concerning [her affair,] with her permission and according to her instructions.\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They stipulated between themselves concerning hate and lov[e and li]fe and death.\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[And all] the stipulations of the court fr[om beginning to end are binding for [them].\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[And with this understanding, the t]wo sides [concluded and ag[reed...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
